\underline{User Story 8}: As a user, I want to see statistics of the e-bike, so that I can monitor the e-bike \\
Scenario 1: User see the hire e-bike
\begin{customlist}
\item Given: The user has sign in and hired a e-bike
\item When: The user hired a e-bike
\item Then: The system shows statistics of the e-bike
\end{customlist}
Scenario 2: User see the e-bike in use
\begin{customlist}
\item Given: The user has sign in and hired a e-bike
\item When: The user ride the e-bike
\item Then: The system update and show the statistics of the e-bike
\end{customlist}